    "excerpt": "An AI chatbot can answer repetitive questions, capture enquiries, and route visitors to the right team — but it isn't automatically worth adding to every business website. Here's what a chatbot can realistically do, what it actually costs to run well, and the specific situations where a simple contact form still wins.",
