                        'Accessibility & Keyboard Navigation: Tab through lead forms using only the keyboard to verify semantic HTML and accessible focus states.',
                        'Authorship Transparency: Inquire which components were engineered in-house versus subcontracted or inherited from legacy agency builds.',
                        'Post-Launch Upgrades: Ask how the team handles framework upgrades, dependency maintenance, and automated security patching after launch.'
